@startuml
title T12-WF10 — AI Next Best Action Agent
start
:01 | Webhook Trigger\nreceive an authenticated internal dispatch from NestJS after entity-level access checks.;
:02 | Code: Validate Entity Reference\nvalidate entity type and ID.;
:03 | HTTP Request: Get Entity Profile\nfetch customer/lead profile.;
:04 | HTTP Request: Get Qualification/Score\nretrieve latest eligible qualification and score, if applicable.;
:05 | HTTP Request: Get Interaction History\nretrieve recent engagement.;
:06 | HTTP Request: Get Follow-up/Segment Context\nobtain sequence state and segment membership.;
:07 | Code: Generate Candidate Actions\ncreate a bounded candidate set using explicit business rules.;
:08 | HTTP Request: AI Rank/Explain Actions\nrank only the allowed candidates and explain why.;
:09 | Code: Validate Action\nenforce action allowlist, evidence references and confidence thresholds.;
:10 | HTTP Request: Save Recommendation\npersist recommendation in a backend workflow/result record.;
if (11 | Human approval required?) then (yes)
:12 | HTTP Request: Request Backend Review/Notification\nask NestJS to create or ensure an approval task idempotently, never execute a high-impact action automatically in this workflow;
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
